      "message": "fix(motion): gate the rotary seam ring on cover-end contact, not span\n\nA boundary loop that spans a whole cover period but touches no cover\nend was trimmed by the seam rule. The ring gate now tests seam contact:\na loop that reaches a cover end within the seam reach wraps the seam;\none that spans a period mid-cover closes as the no-seam case does.\n\nRefs #3168",
